            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Insieme delle disposizioni normative, organizzative e didattiche che disciplinano la struttura del sistema educativo, definendone i percorsi, i livelli, i titoli rilasciati, le modalità di accesso, i requisiti di frequenza e di valutazione, nonché i criteri per il conseguimento delle qualificazioni in un quadro di  coerenza,  validità giuridica e riconoscimento istituzionale.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>The set of legal, organisational, and educational provisions governing the structure of the education system, defining its programmes, levels, qualifications awarded, admission requirements, attendance and assessment requirements, as well as the criteria for the award of qualifications, within a framework that ensures coherence, legal validity, and institutional recognition.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Regulatory Framework</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>unstable</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language/>
              </object>
            </annotation>
